Milestone: Articulated DS inspection with optional locked gameplay orientation.
Dependencies: 79 separate DS; 85 independent fixed-orientation desk placement.
Purpose: Let the owner rotate the DS body and adjust its hinge independently,
lock a preferred gameplay pose, and use a visible physical power button.

Tasks:
- [x] Add independent body/hinge inspection controls and a bounded hinge slider.
- [x] Lock body and hinge together for gameplay, preserving the desk pose.
- [x] Default unlocked gameplay to fully open, flat and camera-facing.
- [x] Add a visible front power button using the existing DS lifecycle.
- [x] Qualify native LCD/button/stylus input and physical power in a locked pose.
- [x] Qualify table/system transitions, mobile framing and unlocked reset.
