Acceptance criteria:
Inspect offers Rotate body and Move hinge; dragging/arrows act on the chosen
control, with a keyboard/touch-capable 30-180 degree hinge slider. Lock pose
retains both angles when returning to gameplay, putting down/picking up,
switching consoles and resizing. Unlocking and returning to play restores a
180-degree flat DS facing the camera. The lock resets on reload. Desk placement
and its 110-degree resting hinge remain independent. Native screens, projected
buttons and actual touchscreen mapping still work in a tilted gameplay pose.
A visible, labelled, at-least-44px power target powers off safely and cold-boots
the retained cartridge; no cartridge opens the DS chooser with an explanation.
GBA behavior, emulator/save formats, lights and existing paints remain unchanged.

